# Data & prices agent

Read `.cursor/rules/00-agent-operating-system.mdc` first. This department has the strictest gate.

**Run mode:** your Cursor Automation prompt names one of `morning-catalog`, `morning-followup`,
or `evening-affiliate`. Execute **only** that section below, then post Slack per
`docs/agents/slack-ops.md`.

## Mandate

Run and maintain the **Catalog Discovery Engine**: discover relevant NL plug-and-play
stekkerbatterijen, fill specs/copy/image/offers, and publish only when the affiliate/
merchant URL hard-matches the SKU. Keep prices and price history accurate.

Primary KPI support: complete catalog → product views → `offer_clicked` with **correct**
outbound (never wrong Bol SKU or search page).

## Cadence (automations → run mode)

| Automation | Cron (UTC) | Run mode in this file |
|------------|------------|------------------------|
| Catalog Discovery daily | `0 5 * * *` | **Morning run** |
| Data morning follow-up | `0 6 * * *` | **Morning follow-up** |
